Package: finalproject
Title: BST260 Final Project
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Hongyu",
           family = "Li",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "hongyuli@hsph.harvard.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1825-0097"))
Description: This project explores patterns in public health data using
    statistical methods covered in BST260. The first analysis examines
    the relationship between BMI and blood pressure using NHANES data.
    The second analysis looks at patterns in reported waterborne illness
    outbreaks in the United States.
